.DS_Store
# The browser scaffolds `.gitignore` already keeps out of the repository. They
# are untracked, so `vsce` was picking them up off the working tree and shipping
# them inside the extension.
.*-preview.html
# The same scaffolds written beside the bundles they load. `dist/` ships, so
# these rode along with it — 142 KB of preview harness in a 127 KB extension.
# Nothing in the extension references them; only the browser preview does.
dist/harness/**
